<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate unchanged at 23.80 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate unchanged at 23.80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate for Tuesday, July 1, was fixed at 23.80 percent, unchanged from the rate for June 30, Banco de Mexico said on Monday.</p>
<p>The new rate will be published in Tuesday's edition of the Mexican government's Official Gazette.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is revised each working day, and is valid for the day after it is set.</p>
<p>(( -- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558))</p>
